# Copy to .env for local development. Optional — the app runs without it and
# only the "CHECK" (ALDI ad) button is disabled.
#
# On Vercel this belongs in Settings -> Environment Variables, not in a file:
# /api/deals runs on the server and reads it from the environment there.
#
# ⚠️ Every press of CHECK bills real API usage, and this call uses the
# web-search tool, which costs more than a plain message. See the README.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---- Instacart (optional, free) -------------------------------------------
# Powers "Open in Instacart". Without it that button says it isn't set up and
# "Copy for Claude" still works. A development key is self-service from the
# Instacart developer dashboard and works immediately; a production key needs
# Instacart's review first.
# INSTACART_API_KEY=

# development (default) hits connect.dev.instacart.tools;
# production hits connect.instacart.com and needs an approved key.
# INSTACART_ENV=development

# ---- Access gate (optional, recommended if you set either key above) ------
# Unset by default: /api/deals and /api/instacart are open to anyone who finds
# the URL, which only matters once a key above makes them worth spending
# against. Set this to require a passphrase — the browser prompts once per
# device and remembers the answer in localStorage from then on.
# APP_ACCESS_KEY=
